msgid "ReliefSettings"
msgstr "ReliefSettings"

msgid ""
"ReliefSettings 是 C++/FLTK 系统设置中心，可从 IceWM 的设置菜单或 ``reliefsettings`` "
"命令启动。应用使用独立的 ``reliefsettings`` gettext 翻译域，随系统提供中文和日语资源。语言列表提供 "
"English、中文与日本語。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefSettings is a C++/FLTK system settings center, launched from IceWM's "
"settings menu or with ``reliefsettings``. It uses a separate "
"``reliefsettings`` gettext domain, with Chinese and Japanese resources "
"supplied by the system. The language list offers English, Chinese, and "
"Japanese."

msgid "语言、显示与键盘"
msgstr "Language, Display, and Keyboard"

msgid ""
"用户设置保存在 ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/reliefos/``。变量为空或使用相对路径时， 采用 "
"``$HOME/.config/reliefos/``。新建目录模式为 0700，配置文件模式为 0600。保存使用 POSIX "
"文件接口、同目录临时文件和原子重命名，并检查打开 设置后是否已有其他程序修改文件。桌面操作使用独立的 POSIX 建议锁，防止 "
"多个设置窗口同时预览和恢复显示模式或键盘布局。"
msgstr ""
"User settings are saved in ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/reliefos/``. If the variable "
"is empty or uses a relative path, ``$HOME/.config/reliefos/`` is used. New "
"directories have mode 0700 and configuration files mode 0600. Saving uses "
"POSIX file interfaces, same-directory temporary files, and atomic rename, "
"and checks whether another program changed the file after settings were "
"opened. Desktop operations use a separate POSIX advisory lock to prevent "
"multiple settings windows from simultaneously previewing and restoring "
"display modes or keyboard layouts."

msgid ""
"``locale.conf`` 使用 ``LANG=zh_CN.UTF-8`` 等 locale.conf 赋值语法。 选择“系统默认”移除用户的 "
"LANG 覆盖，现有其他区域类别赋值保留。登录 Shell 与 XDM 会话导入经过验证的 LANG 和 LC_* 值，系统默认值仍来自 "
"``/etc/reliefos/locale.conf``。语言修改在下次登录生效。"
msgstr ""
"``locale.conf`` uses locale.conf assignment syntax such as "
"``LANG=zh_CN.UTF-8``. Selecting System Default removes the user's LANG "
"override while preserving existing assignments for other locale categories. "
"Login shells and XDM sessions import validated LANG and LC_* values; system "
"defaults still come from ``/etc/reliefos/locale.conf``. Language changes "
"take effect at the next login."

msgid ""
"``desktop.conf`` 是 ReliefSettings 的键值配置文件。XKB_LAYOUT 和 XKB_VARIANT 记录 XKB "
"规则中的布局、变体标识。DISPLAY 行由空格分隔 输出名称、模式名称和刷新率。同一输出只能出现一次。下面给出配置示例。"
msgstr ""
"``desktop.conf`` is ReliefSettings' key-value configuration file. XKB_LAYOUT"
" and XKB_VARIANT store layout and variant identifiers from XKB rules. "
"DISPLAY lines contain a space-separated output name, mode name, and refresh "
"rate. Each output may appear only once. A configuration example follows."

msgid ""
"键盘布局和变体从系统安装的 XKB ``evdev.lst`` 读取，通过原版 ``setxkbmap`` "
"应用。选择系统默认清除下次登录的覆盖。中文输入由会话的 输入法提供。"
msgstr ""
"Keyboard layouts and variants are read from the installed XKB ``evdev.lst`` "
"and applied through the original ``setxkbmap``. Choosing System Default "
"clears the override for the next login. Chinese input is provided by the "
"session's input method."

msgid ""
"显示模式通过原版 ``xrandr`` 读取和应用，只提供 X server 实际报告的模式， "
"仅调整已启用输出的分辨率与刷新率。独立子进程执行预览、15 秒确认和 恢复，关闭应用或预览超时都会恢复原模式，确认后才保存。恢复失败会显示 "
"诊断。登录时只恢复仍连接、已启用且仍提供该模式的输出。"
msgstr ""
"Display modes are read and applied through the original ``xrandr``. Only "
"modes actually reported by the X server are offered, and only the resolution"
" and refresh rate of enabled outputs are adjusted. A separate child process "
"handles previews, a 15-second confirmation period, and restoration. Closing "
"the application or letting the preview time out restores the original mode; "
"saving occurs only after confirmation. Restoration failures display "
"diagnostics. At login, only outputs that remain connected, enabled, and "
"still offer the mode are restored."

msgid ""
"配置文件作为数据解析，登录脚本通过验证后的赋值导入环境。 若原子重命名已经完成、随后目录同步失败，界面保留已应用的设置并报告同步 "
"错误。诊断窗口支持滚动查看命令输出。重启前应处理存储错误并重新保存。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration files are parsed as data; login scripts import the environment"
" through validated assignments. If atomic rename succeeds but directory sync"
" then fails, the interface keeps the applied settings and reports the sync "
"error. The diagnostic window provides scrollable command output. Resolve "
"storage errors and save again before rebooting."

msgid "系统时区与管理入口"
msgstr "System Time Zone and Administration Entry Points"

msgid ""
"时区列表来自 IANA tzdata 的 ``/usr/share/zoneinfo/zone.tab``，可输入城市或 "
"区域名称筛选。应用通过临时符号链接及原子重命名更新 ``/etc/localtime``， 指向已安装的 TZif "
"文件。系统时钟本身不受影响。新的进程使用新时区， 已有进程的缓存更新时间由其 C 库与应用决定。"
msgstr ""
"The time zone list comes from IANA tzdata's ``/usr/share/zoneinfo/zone.tab``"
" and can be filtered by city or region name. The application updates "
"``/etc/localtime`` using a temporary symbolic link and atomic rename, "
"pointing to an installed TZif file. The system clock itself is unaffected. "
"New processes use the new time zone; when existing processes refresh cached "
"settings depends on their C library and application."

msgid ""
"普通用户修改时区时由上游 sudo 与 ReliefAskpass 完成认证，设置中心执行 固定的 ``--set-timezone`` "
"辅助入口。该入口要求有效 UID 为 root，只接受 时区标识，目标目录固定为 ``/etc`` 与 ``/usr/share/zoneinfo``。"
msgstr ""
"When a regular user changes the time zone, upstream sudo and ReliefAskpass "
"provide authentication, and the settings center invokes the fixed ``--set-"
"timezone`` helper entry point. This entry point requires effective UID root "
"and accepts only a time zone identifier; target directories are fixed to "
"``/etc`` and ``/usr/share/zoneinfo``."

msgid ""
"网络和服务页启动已安装的 Network Controller 与 OpenRC Controller， "
"各管理器负责自己的认证和操作。相应组件未安装时入口禁用。"
msgstr ""
"The Network and Services pages launch the installed Network Controller and "
"OpenRC Controller. Each manager handles its own authentication and "
"operations. Entry points are disabled when the corresponding components are "
"not installed."

msgid "构建配置"
msgstr "Build Configuration"

msgid ""
"``APP_RELIEFSETTINGS`` 组件默认启用，可分别控制构建、镜像成员和入口。 原版 xrandr、setxkbmap 通过 Xorg "
"APK 集合安装，tzdata 通过基础 APK 集合 安装。其下载身份固定在依赖锁中。"
msgstr ""
"The ``APP_RELIEFSETTINGS`` component is enabled by default, with separate "
"controls for building, image inclusion, and menu entry. Original xrandr and "
"setxkbmap are installed through the Xorg APK set, and tzdata through the "
"base APK set. Their download identities are pinned in the dependency lock."

msgid ""
"``make app-reliefsettings nls`` 构建应用与翻译。定向配置测试为 ``sh tests/build/test-"
"reliefsettings.sh``。"
msgstr ""
"``make app-reliefsettings nls`` builds the application and translations. The"
" targeted configuration test is ``sh tests/build/test-reliefsettings.sh``."
